WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:02.990
Koyume-chan,

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.990
congratulations on getting 
color pages for your manga!

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.360
Thanks!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.920
That just means you're getting more popular!

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.860
Can we see the magazine?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.030
Super popular!

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.200
Koyume in Love

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.830
You've gotten so good at drawing.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.830
Center color

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.790
It's because you were all so 
affected from my manuscript!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:24.340
You've gotten much better drawing boys.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:27.070
You can even say there's a 
lot of love in the drawings.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.030
<i>Definitely looks like Tsu-chan...</i>

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:30.750
<i>Koyume-chan wears her heart on her sleeve.</i>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.330
Isn't the guy's face a little feminine?

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:34.620
You think so?

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.010
<i>Apparently, they're oblivious...</i>

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:57.330
Comic Girls

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:14.830
<i>I need to work hard like Koyume-chan.</i>

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:19.290
<i>I really want to draw a storyboard 
that won't get rejected this time!</i>

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:25.250
Storyboard...

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.000
Storyboard...

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.450
Storyboard,

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:33.460
storyboard, storyboard, 
storyboard, storyboard!

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.770
I can't draw a storyboard!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:41.940
Koyume-chan, have you made 
progress on your next storyboard?

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.440
Not really!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:47.190
I was actually thinking of 
going out for a change of pace.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.130
You haven't finished your storyboard, 
but you're going to go out?

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:54.110
<i>Is that the difference 
between me and Koyume-chan?</i>

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.220
<i>At times like this,</i>

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.920
<i>going outside will produce good manga...</i>

00:02:58.220 --> 00:02:59.610
That's the method?!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:00.740
Oh, hey,

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:01.990
want to come with me, Kaos-chan?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:02.850
Please!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:06.110
Teach me the way of the Koyumethod!

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.700
Koyumethod?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.980
Um...

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.880
What do you usually do when you go out?

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.640
I meet up with friends and we chat,

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:19.380
eat yummy things, or go look at cute clothes!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:26.600
<i>Ah, so the Koyumethod is only for 
normal, sparkly high school girls...</i>

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.480
Then, I can't!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:31.840
Which means... I can't 
draw storyboards, either?!

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.360
It's no use!

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.970
It's a Kaospiral!

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.360
Kaospiral?

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.680
You were planning to go out, too?

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.360
Yup.

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:49.450
The Dark Hero's battle has 
come to an end for now,

00:03:49.450 --> 00:03:50.670
so I think it'd be a great time

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:54.710
to do a peaceful slice of life episode 
through the eyes of the heroine.

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:57.600
Is what my editor said...

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.290
But I haven't been able 
to think of anything fun.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:02.810
Well, leave coming up with fun stuff to me!

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:03.560
Yeah.

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:06.320
I'm glad you came with me, Koyume.

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.730
I'll do my best!

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>I need to look for ideas, too!</i>

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.050
Since the heroine had been 
captured for a long time,

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:20.170
she's exhausted from all the fighting.

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.980
So the first thing on her mind is...

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:23.500
Sweets!

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.490
Meat!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:26.800
I messed up...

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.240
It's fine!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.080
It's your manga, Tsubasa-san.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.010
This parfait is so cute...

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:36.660
I'm not worthy to partake 
in something this cute!

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:38.000
You can't eat it?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.080
Want some help?

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.470
Are you okay?

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.050
Don't push yourself too much.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.020
You get stomachaches so easily, Kaos-chan.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.130
The heroine is a really pretty princess,

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:51.300
but her fighting stats are really high, 
so meat might be a good idea.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:53.090
Here are your pancakes.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:55.100
This looks so yummy!

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:02.160
Tsubasa-san?

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.610
I think liking sweet things is cuter.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:05.830
No, no!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.500
I think liking heartier things is great, too!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.340
Speaking so seriously when you've 
got whipped cream on your face...

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.520
That's really cute.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.170
Thank You Sale!!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.940
I'm sure once the princess 
goes out into the city,

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:22.370
she'll want some clothes, too.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.690
This is so cute!

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:26.980
I love the ribbon!

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.180
Don't you think so?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:29.620
All right.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:31.090
Let's have the heroine wear that.

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.310
Tsubasa-san, are you actually 
thinking this through?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:34.570
I am.

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:37.220
The heroine in my mind is you, Koyume,

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.930
so if you think it's cute...

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.280
Please don't put that much trust in me!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.930
I'm just a normal person!

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.570
Jeez, Tsubasa-san...

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.790
You're a girl, too, aren't you, Tsubasa-chan?

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:49.720
Well, yeah, but...

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.340
Aren't there any clothes 
that you want to wear?

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:53.010
Not really.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.410
As long as they're easy 
to draw, clothes are...

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.900
Ey, ey, ey!

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:57.620
You're lying!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:05:59.860
Then you wouldn't mind them being naked?!

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.150
I-I don't want that!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:02.580
I'm so sorry!

00:06:03.350 --> 00:06:05.050
Their roles have been reversed!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.110
Take a proper look in the mirror!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:12.260
There must be clothes you want to try on.
You have such a nice figure!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.000
Er, um...

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.730
If I had to choose...

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:18.210
I'd probably choose pants over a skirt...

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.880
Pants, eh?

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.730
Koyume!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.810
I figured out your size.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.170
You should choose whichever
one of these you like.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.000
Okay...

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:32.330
I choose this one.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.370
Okay!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.990
Next, we need to pick out a top for you.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.560
Well?

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.080
Isn't it exciting wearing clothes 
you picked out for yourself?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.340
Yeah... It is.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.440
What else?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.570
Pick anything!

00:06:46.570 --> 00:06:49.300
Tell me what you think is cute.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.090
Knickknacks or anything!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.510
Um... I'll go look.

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:57.060
What a beautiful sight!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:01.200
How much do I have to pay to keep watching?

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.980
What are you talking about, Kaos-chan?

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.410
This...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.360
It's a chick.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.120
I'm going to die from the cuteness!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.620
I'm sorry!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.490
Did I make a mistake again?

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:19.770
Koyume-chan's amazing!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.490
Tsu-chan's acting like her old self.

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.120
Huh?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.160
When I first met Tsu-chan,

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:27.600
her taste in manga was boyish,

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.210
but everything else about 
her was really girly.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:33.400
Hey, so when my hair gets longer,

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:34.850
I'm going to braid it into two pigtails.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.930
Then I'll tie them with chick hair ties.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:37.990
Great idea!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.260
That'll look great on you!

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:42.470
You're also cute like a 
little chick, Tsu-chan.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.570
Why are you so tiny?

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:45.790
I'm normal.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.030
You're the one who's big, Rukki.

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:51.080
But the more she got into drawing manga,

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.110
the more stoic she became...

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:57.280
She said she could concentrate on 
her manga more if she cut her hair,

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.330
so she chopped it all off.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:04.600
Then everything girly got eliminated from 
Tsu-chan's life, one after another.

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.480
That definitely sounds 
like Tsubasa-san, yes...

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:09.770
But...

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.510
It doesn't look like Koyume-chan's 
being bothersome.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:13.350
Yes!

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.350
I expect nothing less from the Koyumethod!

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:16.970
Koyumethod?

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.230
Tsu-chan went right to 
work on her storyboard.

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.730
Thank goodness!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.190
It's just...

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:25.610
She keeps changing clothes 
depending on the character,

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:27.660
which seems to be
taking up a lot of time.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:31.650
Isn't that okay as long 
as she can empathize?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.690
My editor praised my storyboard a lot.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:38.550
I was still all excited from earlier 
that my inking went really well.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.120
I was told the surveys 
were really positive, too.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.610
That's great.

00:08:42.610 --> 00:08:44.600
It's all thanks to you, Tsubasa-san.

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:48.120
Looks like their synergy 
is really paying off.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:48.930
Yes.

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.760
They're like the ideal senpai and kohai.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.020
I'm so sorry, Kaos-chan!

00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.900
I haven't been able to do anything for you!

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.050
I'm so sorry that I'm not worth mentoring!

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:07.500
Hey, Koyume-chan, I hate to bring this up...

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.950
But have you gotten rounder?

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.340
You think so?

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.020
Um...

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.270
It can't be...

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.680
You're right!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:18.530
I've never seen that number before!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:19.660
<i>Why?</i>

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.700
<i>Is it because I got too giddy about my manga
getting serialized and overate like crazy?</i>

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:26.030
<i>Because I had dessert every 
time I went out with friends?</i>

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:30.030
<i>Too many reasons are coming to mind!</i>

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.320
Are you okay, Koyume-chan?

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:34.140
Koyume, let's eat some cream puffs together.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.340
Tsu-chan!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:40.560
If I eat that... will I become a piggy?

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.890
In my opinion,

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:46.530
I don't think you'd be any less 
cute if you gained a bit more.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:50.300
But if she doesn't lose a bit in her tummy,

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.020
it won't be good for my sketching...

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:55.500
It becomes really hard to lose 
weight once you become an adult.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:10:00.550
Please stop squeezing and grabbing at me...

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.590
I can't draw because I'm 
too worried about my weight...

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.620
I know!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:08.140
I'll wear some cute clothes 
to make myself feel better!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:10.110
I'll wear this one!

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:13.760
Huh? What?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:23.010
Episode 9
"Kaospiral"

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:23.010
Urgh...
Must resist...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:23.010
Today's Snack
Pudding
It's in the fridge~

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.970
I'll lose weight...

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.750
Koyume-chan!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:29.360
How do you lose weight, Ruki-sensei?

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:33.300
You should definitely make the most 
out of the time you spend in the bath.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:37.070
If you massage when your 
blood flow is better,

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.420
you'll get thinner and 
you'll feel less fatigued.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.630
There's also massages to 
make your boobs big—

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:44.290
What about around here?

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:46.390
Koyume-chan!

00:10:46.390 --> 00:10:49.360
Now that you've touched me, 
you can't complain if I touch you back!

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.530
You're not getting away!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.590
They're too big!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:54.620
What the heck is this?!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:57.540
Being able to actually feel these 
will definitely help with my manga!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.020
No!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.990
No!

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.520
<i>This is too stimulating for me!</i>

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.600
<i>Just the sounds... Just the sounds...</i>

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:07.640
Oh?

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:08.680
Did you catch a cold?

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:13.650
I think you'll just have to work out.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.770
But doesn't lifting weights 
make your arms and legs bulky?

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:20.450
What should I do to look 
just right like you do, Tsubasa-san?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.440
Actually...

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:24.720
It's been bugging me that I haven't 
been able to gain much muscle.

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.190
I'm trying to get bigger, 
but my arms just keep getting thinner.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.300
You've got such a girlish figure!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.940
Can I tag along on your 
early morning run tomorrow?

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.010
Sure.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.680
Koyume, wake up.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.270
You're amazing...

00:11:42.270 --> 00:11:43.970
You wake up this early,

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.580
go running, go to school,

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:48.600
and have a serialized manga.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.320
I think I'm just used to it.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:51.770
When you think you have to do it,

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:53.220
your lifestyle changes.

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.060
Okay, I can do this!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.570
If you go too hard at first...

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.570
So I guess Koyume-chan went 
on the early morning run, too.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:03.620
Yes.

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.280
I wonder if she'll be okay.

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:08.950
Tsu-chan's pretty intense when 
it comes to working out.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.070
We're back.

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.250
Oh, they're back.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.930
Koyume-chan?!

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.010
That was a great training session.

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.420
No snacks

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:21.420
Lose that
weight!

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.540
I'm not eating any more sweets!

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.040
My weight's almost back to normal,

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.370
so I need to concentrate on my manuscript!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.140
Right!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.560
I'll do my best and hold off, too.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.540
Thanks, Kaos-chan!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.560
It's a
pleasure to
meet you.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:38.350
Koyume-chan! You got that wrong!

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.090
A hat! He's supposed to be wearing a hat!

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:41.780
O-Oh, no!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.670
Whoopsie...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:47.740
Lose that
weight!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:47.740
No snacks

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:46.270
I have to keep going diligently...

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.750
Diligently...

00:12:47.750 --> 00:12:49.290
Diligently...

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:50.420
Deliciously!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.250
Deliciously?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.330
Koyume-chan?

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:52.920
Nom!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.360
The Sanctuary of Manga Bunhousha

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.360
Manga Time

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:59.060
Um...

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.130
Your drawings seem a bit lifeless.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.420
And the story's not progressing.

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:07.910
This doesn't seem like 
something you usually draw.

00:13:08.340 --> 00:13:09.820
Oh...

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.440
Tsubasa-san!

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.180
Yeah...

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:30.010
Your drawings are usually much livelier.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.960
I think if you push yourself too 
hard it comes out in your drawings.

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:35.330
Right...

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.350
<i>I want to lose weight, wear cute clothes,</i>

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:42.160
<i>and I want Tsubasa-san to think I'm cute.</i>

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:43.620
<i>But...</i>

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.250
<i>Right now, I need to prioritize my manga.</i>

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.510
<i>If I don't, I'm going to regret 
it for the rest of my life!</i>

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.760
Taste the freshness.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:53.400
<i>I'm going to be myself...</i>

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.530
<i>for the sake of my manga!</i>

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:59.850
I'm going to have this 
"Very Berry Collection Sweets!"

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:02.010
And then, after that,

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:03.570
I'm going to redraw everything!

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:09.420
I'll be by your side, then.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:12.080
Let's go running together again.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:14.740
Okay!

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.030
I did it!

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.290
Koyume-chan?

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:34.150
Oh, sorry for waking you up, Kaos-chan.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.040
So you finished your manuscript?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:36.870
Yeah!

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:40.090
I felt so much more energetic 
after eating some sweets!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.050
It's in the bag!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.180
Thank goodness.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.310
I'm glad you're feeling better.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.250
Yes.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.740
This is definitely more 
like you, Koyume-chan.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.000
Sweets are the best energy source.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:59.480
Om nom, nom, nom, nom, nom...

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.870
So basically, Koyume-chan...

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:10.710
concentrated so hard on her work that 
she also succeeded in losing weight?

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:11.930
Yes.

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:15.520
Apparently she went down to her former 
weight, despite eating sweets.

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.190
Yoohoo!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:23.360
Koyume

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:21.900
Wait, you brought your manuscript 
to school, Koyume-chan?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.170
Yeah.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:26.020
I thought I'd turn it in after school.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.860
It's fine that you brought it,

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:29.360
but make sure you don't lose—

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.180
My manuscript...

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:33.410
is missing!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.360
What?!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.650
It's not in our classroom?

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:37.410
No.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.760
M-Maybe you left it back at the dorm.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:40.880
No...

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:43.580
I've been drawing it ever since first period.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.800
Honestly...

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:45.580
No, wait...

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.520
I might've been drawing it in my 
dream around third or fourth period...

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:51.440
It's always disappointing 
when you wake up from that.

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:53.580
Come on, remember already!

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.760
What should I do?

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.440
Tsubasa-san...

00:15:56.440 --> 00:15:58.770
I lose stuff all the time,

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.610
so I'm an expert at finding things!

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.250
Thanks, Koyume.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.420
I'm not sure how reliable that sounds.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:07.240
You always have to retrace your steps!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.230
Good idea!

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:09.640
Which class did you have to 
switch rooms for today?

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:10.600
Um...

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.700
We went to the science lab for third period.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.280
Then, we're going to retrace 
our steps to the science lab!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.870
I'm pretty sure we don't need 
to actually walk backwards.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.110
Science Room

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:20.770
I don't see it...

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:23.650
Yeah, I don't see it either...

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:26.170
Then, let's go look in the lost and found.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:26.880
That's it!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.590
Lost and Found Corner

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.590
Let's write our names
on our belongings!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.880
It's not here!

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:32.050
Hey, my hair tie, ribbon, 
mechanical pencil, and sock!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.300
Faculty Room

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:33.900
What?!

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:36.230
Your manuscript?

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:36.790
Yes...

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:39.120
We haven't been able to find it, 
no matter where we looked.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.090
If someone actually took it...

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:42.210
Oh, no...

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:44.640
Black-kyun's lost somewhere in the school...

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:46.870
I want to take care of him so badly!

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.520
Uh, I'd need you to give him back.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:52.580
I'll tell the other teachers 
that it's something I lost.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.920
That way, even if someone finds it,
they probably won't look inside.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:56.790
P-Please...

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:00.740
It's inefficient if we all 
look in the same spot.

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:03.140
Katsuki-san and Koizuka-san look 
from the first floor and up,

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:06.090
and Irokawa-san and Moeta-san start 
looking from the third floor.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:06.930
Right!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:09.460
Leave any locked areas to me.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.220
You're so cool, Sensei!

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:12.370
You're such an adult!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.460
You're so reliable!

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:14.480
<i>If I find it,</i>

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:17.300
<i>I'll be able to read it 
before any other reader!</i>

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.260
<i>So good!</i>

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:18.960
<i>No, no...</i>

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:19.830
<i>I mustn't.</i>

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.390
<i>But I want to read it, so bad!</i>

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:28.690
It's not in here.

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.090
Let's look again carefully.

00:17:31.090 --> 00:17:32.860
We might've missed something.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.320
I'm so sorry about this, Koyume.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.730
You must be tired since it's
right after your deadline.

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:40.340
I'm causing all of you so much trouble.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:41.530
No!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.620
It's no trouble at all!

00:17:45.170 --> 00:17:47.040
Okay, let's go!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:49.940
Yeah...

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:51.420
We need to find it.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:55.500
<i>Tsubasa-san always pours her heart 
and soul into her manuscript.</i>

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:57.570
<i>She seems calm,</i>

00:17:57.570 --> 00:18:00.420
<i>but I'm sure she's really panicked right now,</i>

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.420
<i>and really shocked.</i>

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.930
<i>I'm going to find it...</i>

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.140
<i>no matter what!</i>

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.330
<i>I wonder where it is.</i>

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:13.610
<i>Where should I look?</i>

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.170
Do you mind if I take a look over here?

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:18.370
Sure, anything for you, Irokawa-san.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.700
<i>I'm so useless...</i>

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.830
Kaos-chan, come here.

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:26.850
Yes?

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:29.010
I think there's something in here.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.130
Okay?

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.190
You're the only one who'd be 
able to search this space.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:35.060
Please!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:39.090
Thank you so much for forcing 
yourself to give me something to do.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.130
Oh, there it is.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:48.660
I got it.

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:49.630
Okay,

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.090
do your best to pull it out.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:51.840
Right!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.730
I know you went through a lot 
of trouble to get this, Kaos...

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:01.220
But I'm sorry, this isn't mine.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:02.580
Right...

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.970
Of course it wouldn't 
actually be back there.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.700
I wonder who it belongs to, then.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.110
It seems pretty old.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.170
I think we can find out who it 
belonged to if we look inside.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:14.000
Want it open it, then?

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:14.010
Girls...

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.110
Sensei!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:21.270
We found this old case!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.570
Huh?

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:26.590
Isn't this...

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:29.390
I don't think it's a professional's...

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:32.400
But you can tell how hard they worked on it.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.640
<i>M-My manuscript for manga club...</i>

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.350
<i>It was still here?</i>

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:38.790
Is something the matter, Sensei?

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.840
N-N-No, nothing at all.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.320
Someone lost this, as well, right?

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:48.170
I-I-I'll go take another 
look in the faculty room,

00:19:48.170 --> 00:19:51.330
so you should all start over, too.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.000
Right...

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.410
<i>Why did they have to find this now?</i>

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:00.390
<i>This is not good for my heart...</i>

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.460
I can't believe we still can't find it.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.300
Let's start over again.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.420
It's okay.

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:10.390
If we've looked this much and 
we still haven't found it,

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.330
I don't think we'll find it.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.970
If my manuscript is leaked before publication

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:16.850
or my identity is revealed,

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:22.860
I'm just going to cause trouble to the 
editorial department and to school.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.610
And to you girls, too.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.690
Tsu-chan!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:28.920
It's too early to give up!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.090
Yes, I think so, too.

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:34.850
Thanks, everyone. It's okay, though.

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:38.210
It's my fault. This is all my fault.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.290
I'm prepared for the consequences.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.570
Tsubasa-chan...

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.940
Don't hold back.

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:50.680
You know we'll help you in any way we can.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:54.360
Yup!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:03.690
Seriously...

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:06.070
Thank you.

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:09.820
Oh, hey!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.410
This was in the science lab,

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:17.670
but when I went to deliver 
it to you, you weren't there.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.180
This is my manuscript case!

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.080
Yay!

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.320
Thank you so much! Thank you so much!

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.260
You don't have to be so formal.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.890
We're friends, after all.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:32.670
Huh?

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:33.650
Do you know her?

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:34.480
No...

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:36.980
I'm sorry... Who are you?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.010
Oh, right.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.060
I guess you can't tell.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.730
It's me.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:51.170
Fuura-senpai!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.620
Thank you for always reacting that way.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.640
I'll gladly take it!

00:23:30.260 --> 00:23:32.510
Ba-dump Ba-dump

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:32.760
I'll gladly accept anything 
from you, Kaos-chan.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:34.600
Hup Hup Hup Hup

00:23:32.760 --> 00:23:34.590
Hup, hup, hup, hup...

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:35.700
A mountain of rejected storyboards!

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.560
A mountain of rejected storyboards

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:36.560
Next time,

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.860
"It's Not Fair That Michiru Gets All The Love."

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:40.020
It's Not Fair That Michiru Gets All The Love

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:40.020
Look forward to it!
